d <a target=3D"_blank" href=3D"https://www.AI Academy by RiWoT.com/articles/setting-=
up-jupyter-notebook" class=3D"g-md-a gamut-1r92bn9-AnchorBase e14vpv2g0">wh=
en we installed Jupyter Notebook</a>. Note that Jupyter Notebook works best=
 on Chrome, Safari and Firefox browsers. </p>
<p class=3D"g-md-p">If you would prefer, here is <a target=3D"_blank" href=
=3D"https://www.AI Academy by RiWoT.com/article/how-to-use-jupyter-notebooks" class=
=3D"g-md-a gamut-1r92bn9-AnchorBase e14vpv2g0">a video walkthrough</a>.</p>
<p class=3D"g-md-p">If you have Miniconda or just want to use the Command L=
ine, open the BASH/zsh Shell (Mac) or Anaconda Prompt (Windows) and launch =
a Jupyter Notebook with the command:</p>
<pre class=3D"g-md-pre"><pre class=3D"gamut-mu6hz5 e1rzuoz70"><code><div da=
ta-lang=3D"plaintext" class=3D"gamut-1rlug0v epnovk10"><span><span class=3D=
"mtk1">jupyter notebook</span></span><br><span><span></span></span><br></di=
v></code></pre></pre>
<p class=3D"g-md-p">A Jupyter Notebook interface will appear in your defaul=
t browser. (If you don=E2=80=99t know how to use the command line, check ou=
t our <a target=3D"_blank" href=3D"https://www.AI Academy by RiWoT.com/catalog/langu=
age/bash" class=3D"g-md-a gamut-1r92bn9-AnchorBase e14vpv2g0">Bash courses<=
/a>.)</p>
<p class=3D"g-md-p"><img alt=3D"Jupyter Notebook file directory" class=3D"g=
-md-img" src=3D"https://static-assets.AI Academy by RiWoT.com/Paths/data-science-car=
eer-path/getting-started-off-platform/jupyter-directory-browser.png"></p>
